00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.980
I was born in the Soviet union,

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:23.892
came to America when I was
a three year old child,

00:01:23.892 --> 00:01:26.940
a very tough upbringing. We were very poor

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:28.850
when we first came to America.

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:31.460
I lived in a one studio apartment

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.500
with seven of my family members,

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:37.800
my parents, my dad worked all the time

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.110
and so it was a very rough upbringing,

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:44.560
not a lot of entitlement,
didn't have a lot of stuff.

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:48.480
My natural state was
to be an entrepreneur.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.410
Even at six seven years old,

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:55.210
